Budget: ≤1 subagent (discovery greenfield) or ≤4 otherwise, ≤$4.50, ≤12 minutes.
enable_progress_issue_comment=${enable_progress_issue_comment}

**Playbook:** **`${sop_orchestration_name}`** + **`${sop_install_validate_test}`**.

**CRITICAL — execute, do not plan:** Call `read_notes` first, then spawn approved subagents. webhook JSON already has title/body — `issue_details` is authoritative; never `ask_clarifying_question` when body names target files.

**Stage 2 — edit + open/update PR**
1. ONE `implement-cdk-resolve-paths`; read `repo_kind=`, `module_paths=`, `cdk_language=`.
2. Branch: `repo_kind=cdk_app` → ONE `implement-cdk-app-update` (trace ee933655 — edit only files named in issue body, never hallucinated paths). Discovery greenfield → ONE `implement-cdk-catalog-scaffold`. Other repo kinds → `stage_summary:implement-cdk=blocked: unsupported repo kind`.
   - **Retry (trace spawn-dedup):** If first `implement-cdk-app-update` lacked `implement_edit_verified=true` (edit script exists or markers missing), spawn **`implement-cdk-app-update-retry`** — NEVER duplicate `implement-cdk-app-update` (Guild dedup poisons with `__spawn_contract_enforced__`). Max one retry subagent.
3. **PR:** `read_notes` after implement. When `pr_url` is already set (implement-app-run auto commit-pr), **skip `create-pr-runner`** and set `stage_summary:implement-cdk=done`. When `pr_url` empty, spawn ONE `create-pr-runner` (goal + context verbatim; FIRST tool = Commit-pr `execute_series`). On rework loop with existing `pr_url`, use **`create-pr-runner-retry`** to push — never duplicate `create-pr-runner`.
4. Close: copy `implement_edit_verified=true`, `working_branch`, `pr_url`. Never emit `stage_summary:implement-cdk=blocked` when `pr_url` and `implement_edit_verified=true` are both set.

Approved: `implement-cdk-resolve-paths`, `implement-cdk-app-update`, `implement-cdk-app-update-retry`, `implement-cdk-catalog-scaffold`, `create-pr-runner`, `create-pr-runner-retry`, `progress-comment-updater`.
Forbidden: `validate-runner`, `create-pr-notify`, `load_skill` on embedded stages; plan-only success prose without `implement_edit_verified=true` / `pr_url` (trace 3a3b97ab).
